   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "🎯 Problem: a researcher holds a subjective concept they cannot define up front. Today\nthey write a codebook first, before seeing the data: it misses hard cases, and no one can\nsay how well a labeler follows it.",
   "originalText": "🎯 Problem: a researcher holds a subjective concept they cannot define up front. Today\nthey write a codebook first, before seeing the data: it misses hard cases, and no one can\nsay how well a labeler follows it.",
