   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "🏆 Contributions: a tool to build your own benchmark, then pick the labeler for all your data\n· C1 an interactive guideline: drawn out on real data, every rule yours (✨1) · C2 it\ntransfers: a weak model following G* labels like you · C3 a benchmark that knows where it\nis unsure; quick: you read only borders (✨2), rounds pick the most valuable (✨3), a\nsealed exam (✨4).",
   "originalText": "🏆 Contributions: a tool to build your own benchmark, then pick the labeler for all your data\n· C1 an interactive guideline: drawn out on real data, every rule yours (✨1) · C2 it\ntransfers: a weak model following G* labels like you · C3 a benchmark that knows where it\nis unsure; quick: you read only borders (✨2), rounds pick the most valuable (✨3), a\nsealed exam (✨4).",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 6,
