   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A round: both labelers label U with G_t; SORT\nputs each item in one of 7 pools; you approve the\npick (b); you rule each pick, which is gold; you\nrule each rule; CLOSE makes G_t ← G_t+1, then\nanother round or Stop.",
