   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1596,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1596,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "🧮 Across pools, b is split by expected error mass: a pool's size in X (estimated from U) × its error rate in past audits; within a pool, the highest v(x) first. Stop when every pool's error mass is under ε.",
   "originalText": "🧮 Across pools, b is split by expected error mass: a pool's size in X (estimated from U) × its error rate in past audits; within a pool, the highest v(x) first. Stop when every pool's error mass is under ε.",
   "fontSize": 26,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s-d010e67192a5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -6290,
   "y": 5554.0,
   "width": 2391.82,
   "height": 65.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "s-a87c2e309b22",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1597,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1597,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "🔒 Two guards live in the tools, not in the agent: the final exam is not in the index, so no tool returns it; every item shown to anyone is logged, so we know what a person has seen; and each step has a\nreading budget (c_ask, c_pick, c_learn): past it, a tool returns ids, counts and labels, never text.",
   "originalText": "🔒 Two guards live in the tools, not in the agent: the final exam is not in the index, so no tool returns it; every item shown to anyone is logged, so we know what a person has seen; and each step has a\nreading budget (c_ask, c_pick, c_learn): past it, a tool returns ids, counts and labels, never text.",
   "fontSize": 26,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
